ALERT: Agents must read `AGENT=1 cron-person skill` before using this tool.
command: cron-person completion powershell
summary: Generate the autocompletion script for powershell
description: Generate the autocompletion script for powershell.
  To load completions in your current shell session:
  cron-person completion powershell | Out-String | Invoke-Expression
  To load completions for every new session, add the output of the above command
  to your powershell profile.
usage: cron-person completion powershell [flags]
flags:
  --config string: Path to custom configuration file (default: $XDG_CONFIG_HOME/cron-person/config.json)
  -h, --help bool: help for powershell
  --no-descriptions bool: disable completion descriptions
  --store string: Path to custom authorization state file (default: $XDG_STATE_HOME/cron-person/allowed.json)
